      "role": "user",
      "content": "potassium gluconate? i haven't heard of that being used for this before. i'm a little worried about taking a big dose of something like that on my own though... is it actually safe to take 3 grams at once? \n\nand i'm still feeling really lightheaded and my chest feels so tight. if i take the potassium and the magnesium, how long should i wait before i decide it's actually an emergency? i really want to avoid the hospital if i can, so i'm hoping these will work quickly.",
